  "body": "Please add two clarifications:\r\n\r\nIf anchor `<a/>` (without href attribute)  has attribute tabindex and onclick in the same moment and is focused, the ENTER key fires onclick script.\r\n\r\nIf button `<button/>` or `<input type=\"button\"/>` or `<input type=\"submit\"/>` has set onclick, the SPACE key fires onclick script if element is focused.\r\n\r\n",
